  "description": "Whether it's your commute, training ride or bike packing adventure, the BULLS Machete EVO SX 2 redefines boundaries and riding enjoyment. This is thanks to its lightweight carbon frame with lots of clever mounting points, the compact and dynamic Bosch Performance Line SX drive and high-quality components with lots of highlights. Precise gear changes thanks to the wireless SRAM Force XPLR AXS gear system, sporty traction with the new RockShox Rudy Ultimate suspension fork and Mavix carbon wheels leave no room for doubt when it comes to performance. Performance and versatility are complemented by the innovative lighting concept. With the Supernova Starstream Mini in the Rumble Dropbar handlebars and the MonkeyLink Twinlights in the dropouts, the Machete EVO SX 2 offers sporty safety on all routes – fully integrated.",
